WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
When you are finished, just say done.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.180
That's how Quickler knows your inspection is over.

3
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.780
Nothing gets filed until you say it.

4
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:12.080
Then Quickler sorts all your photos and all the words into the right

5
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.180
places, ready for you to improve.
